# Jira Claude Attribution

When creating or updating Jira issues via the MCP Atlassian tools, always add a comment indicating the action was performed via Claude AI assistant.

## Creating Issues

After creating a new Jira issue, add a comment:
> "This issue was created via Claude AI assistant."

## Updating Issues

When making significant updates to an existing issue (editing fields, transitioning status, etc.), add a comment:
> "This issue was updated via Claude AI assistant."

## Adding Comments

When the only action is adding a comment, append a note to the end of the comment:
> "\n\n---\n*Comment added via Claude AI assistant.*"

## Exceptions

- Do not add duplicate attribution if one was already added in the same session for that issue
